<title>FRANCE: France to privatise Credit Lyonnais.</title>
<headline>France to privatise Credit Lyonnais.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday that the government planned to privatise Credit Lyonnais as soon as possible following a third rescue plan for the ailing bank.</p>
<p>He told a news conference that the government would help the bank meet its heavy interest rate commitments, which threaten to plunge it into a loss this year.</p>
</text>
